.coverage
htmlcov/

# Never commit a node's credentials. The bearer token is the only durable
# state the service keeps; everything else is re-obtained from the server.
*.token
token
.env

# Correspondence with the server author. Deliberately untracked: outbound drafts
# get rewritten between sends and would otherwise read as a second, competing
# spec. An earlier set went stale describing a spec two revisions old, which is
# the argument for keeping them out and short-lived.
docs/for-server-author.*
docs/node-ingest-v1.annotated.yml
tools/annotate-spec.py
